      "message": "\u003e Might also be able to use MSRTSS to implement this but only if use of transient textures is guaranteed for the attachment. That doesn\u0027t seem to be guaranteed by the DawnLoadResolveTexture feature.\n\nHuh that is a good point. @lehoangquyen@chromium.org would be the one to ask but I don\u0027t see any such restriction. Since Graphite is the only thing using DawnLoadResolveTexture now maybe we can add that restriction? Graphite will always request a transient MSAA texture on Android.\n\n\u003e It should also be noted that using Dynamic Rendering is gated by the presence of DRLR in this CL, but we really should be able to use it any time the DawnLoadResolveTexture feature isn\u0027t being used as well. \n\nYeah it seems like you should be able to use dynamic_rendering for WebGPU when it\u0027s supported right now.",
